<span id="A1.F5.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.F5.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Keep the answers as short as possible, without leading context.</span></span>
<span id="A1.F5.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.F5.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For example, do not say ’The answer is 2’, simply say ’2’.</span></span>
<span id="A1.F5.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.F5.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;"></span></span>
